1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
You slammed the door. CHEST ON FIRE.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000
You want to SCREAM.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Anger is a HOT COAL...

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,000
They don't feel it. YOU ARE BURNING.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
DROP THE COAL. Right now.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,500
The 3-SECOND RULE. Do not speak.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Separate your teeth. KILL THE FUEL.

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Hurt people HURT PEOPLE.

9
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Inhale ice water. COOL YOUR HEART.

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
I won't let chaos DESTROY MY KINGDOM.

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Who makes you angry IS YOUR MASTER.

12
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Take your crown back. STAY SILENT.
